      "title": "Jobs and Careers",
      "description": "Doane University Jobs and Careers | Doane Tiger Mascot - Thomas the Tiger Skip to Main Content Jobs and Careers Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help About Doane Lincoln Campus Omaha Location Doane Tiger Mascot - Thomas the Tiger Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Doane Tiger Mascot - Thomas the Tiger Department Campus Engagement Job Location Crete, NE (68333) Supervisor Spencer Munson 402-826-8271 spencer.munson@doane.edu Purpose of Job Provide entertainment as our mascot, Thomas, at specific campus and community events. Meet and greet students, staff, faculty and community members, and take pictures with students, faculty, staff and community members to enhance all-around Doane University mascot experience. Provide silent entertainment projecting an enthusiastic and entertaining demeanor. General Description and Duties Have an enthusiastic and high energy at all times to keep the entertainment level high Flexibility of work depends on event and agreed schedule Assist in the development, creation and execution of performances to enhance the Doane mascot experience for tiger fans Preserve the identity of the mascot without deviating from established character including: body language/mannerisms, attitude, and fan interaction Work well in a team environment Commit entirely to the assigned scheduled opportunities for “Thomas” to appear at on-campus and off-campus events Distribute Doane University promotional items designed to help increase school spirit and attendance at events Personally interact with students/staff/faculty/community members you encounter Special Skills or Knowledge Required Warm & engaging personality A professional demeanor and image to prove compatible with Doane University professionalism Independent and self-motivated, while flexible and adaptable A clear understanding of silent communication ability while in costume Flexible work schedule Dance experience preferred Available for up to 10 hours per week Total Weekly Hours Required 3-10 hours per week, $13.50 per hour Physical Demands Posting Detail Information Posting Number STU117 Number of Vacancies 1 Desired Start Date Position End Date (if temporary) Review Start Date Open Date 01/26/2025 Close Date Open Until Filled Special Instructions to Applicant Quick Link for Direct Access to Posting https://doane.peopleadmin.com/postings/2073 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you a current Doane University student? Yes No Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Doane University 1014 Boswell Ave. Crete, NE 68333 Back to top © Doane University is an equal opportunity educator and employer. This site is produced and maintained by Doane University. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
