    "https://doane.peopleadmin.com/postings/2738": {
      "title": "Jobs and Careers",
      "description": "Doane University Jobs and Careers | Cardinal Community Learning Centers (CCLC) After School Program (Crete Pubic Schools) Skip to Main Content Jobs and Careers Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help About Doane Lincoln Campus Omaha Location Cardinal Community Learning Centers (CCLC) After School Program (Crete Pubic Schools) Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Position Details Position Information Position Title Cardinal Community Learning Centers (CCLC) After School Program (Crete Pubic Schools) Department Financial Aid Office Job Location Crete, NE (68333) Supervisor Reports to: CCLC Site Coordinator and Director Purpose of Job Crete Public Schools is seeking applications for CCLC Staff. This is a part-time position within the after-school program. Training is provided. This position is considered open until filled. Hourly Pay is based on related job experience. General Description and Duties Essential Functions: Supervise groups of students attending the after-school program Develop and lead club activities (i.e., arts, science, technology, sports) Clean up at the end of the daily program Assist in serving snack and dinner Other Responsibilities: Interest in building and engaging in positive relationships with students through a variety of activities Highly motivated to help students grow academically and personally A role model for kindness and a positive attitude Responsible and dependable A willingness to be flexible Organized As assigned by the supervisor Special Skills or Knowledge Required Essential Requirements: Satisfactory completion of a criminal background & NE Central Registry check You must qualify for the Federal Work Study Program and be able to work off-campus Experience supervising children is preferred Total Weekly Hours Required Flexible Physical Demands Environment: Inside and Outside Mental Demands: Ability to work under pressure and to meet timelines The ability to perform the following identified physical requirements: Physical Requirements CCLC Posting Detail Information Posting Number STU169 Number of Vacancies Multiple Desired Start Date Position End Date (if temporary) Review Start Date Open Date Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicant Quick Link for Direct Access to Posting https://doane.peopleadmin.com/postings/2735 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you a current Doane University student? Yes No Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Optional Documents Resume Cover Letter Doane University 1014 Boswell Ave. Crete, NE 68333 Back to top © Doane University is an equal opportunity educator and employer. This site is produced and maintained by Doane University. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
